- nested-heredoc-in-cmdsub-hangs: a here-document whose body contains a
  command substitution that itself opens a here-document hangs the
  shell outright. Pre-existing (reproduces on `9bfd1f9f` with no local
  changes); it is why `cmdsub-p.tst` takes minutes -- the case only
  ends via the harness's own 120s per-case `TIMEOUT`.

